<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">LOM</book>
  <para style="h">Looma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Looma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Looma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Looma</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli ali mu usonehele huli ba libundu ba hu tsi a Looma, mu taangu yi nde amiimana mudyenge a nde wu mitatu wu isalu. Nde tondi usupala mudyenge a nde natee hu Looma hu nde hamaaveleto, titswene huuna hu Wesete, natee hu Esipanya, mu uyayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:22-24">15.22-24</ref></char>). Tooni yi muhanda a nde, ni mu uvangimasa nziili a nde, na mu umweese ndongisili a nde huli ba libundu ba musyenge mo wuuna.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Looma, ni nzabisili yi yakuha yi musamu a ndongisili a Pahuli. Nde bibaayaka mu ukuka nde bunuubu: «Nzambi ubatsikaha butsiitsa bwa baatu, bu bo bali mu usa hiitu mu nde, na imiinu mo hiina hyamiikuha» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">1.17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli bibaayaka mu ubindula mambu matatu mu nzabisili a musamu mo wuuna.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mabuli <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1-8">1–8</ref></char> mali mu uyabisa <char style="em">likoongo la ŋa hati lisiingala</char> bibaayaka mikele mi libundu<char style="em">na imiinu </char> mu Nzambi, bi Yisu Kristo ali mu ukuhasa. Ba libundu ba Looma, bali fula-fula ba bavele Bayudaayo. Ka Bayudaayo balaha hu Looma, na bakima bamiikituha ba libundu. Bayudaayo mo baniiba, bali mu uhwada usiingala makesili ma mikele mi libundu bibaayaka Bayudaayo. Bunuubu, ba bavele Bayudaayo, ba bamiikituha ba libundu, utwala kaka usiingala makesili mo maana? Hyuhu mo hiina, hyasinzinyingasa matsimi ma mabundu ma maavelehwada. Pahuli bibaayaka mu uleele ti, baatu boosi bali basumihi, tso ba bavele Bayudaayo, tso ba bali Bayudaayo. Ka a hu bibaayaka na mukele libundu tso mumosi, wu ubayobolo muutu mu lisumu ve. Ka baatu utwala uyoboho mu Livupu la Ngidi, mu tooni ati Yisu Kristo bibaayaka mu ubita bo huli Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mabuli <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 9-11">9–11</ref> </char> mali mu uyambila mu <char style="em">likoongo la ŋa hati bibaayaka Isereli</char>, buli bibaayaka Nzambi hasoolo, <char style="em">na ba libundu</char>. Manganzi ma imiinu hya ba libundu, makangama mu toto Bayudaayo, we bu muti ubakangama mu toto. Ka a Bayudaayo boosi bakituha ba libundu ve. Pahuli bibaayaka mu uyabisa ti, Nzambi bibaayaka mu uhwada mu utondo na uteele baatu ba nde. Na ilumbu, itwadi na mabuli makima ma baatu, Isereli hyutsikaha bubwe bwa Nzambi, bu bubamonehele mu Yisu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mabuli <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12-15">12–15</ref> </char> mali mu uyambila <char style="em">mu mbiili a mu libundu la Yisu Kristo</char>. Pahuli bibaayaka mu ubindula buni laafwana uyusa Nzambi, na uba mu hyenze na bana. Nde bibaayaka mu utuma huli banga imiinu hi hyavangama, mu ubahwadisa banga imiinu hi hyakolo. Nzambi ubayobolo baatu boosi mu masumu na mu lipfu. Bunuubu, bo utwala uba itwadi ŋa hati la bo, na uba kaka itwadi na Kristo, mu likumbasa bibaayaka Livupu la Ngidi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Muhanda a Pahuli huli bisu Looma, bibaayaka mu usuka mu mabwehe ma malahi (buli la <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 16">16</ref></char>). Nde bibaayaka mu utata manduhi ma malahi ma babahala, na ma bakaasu. Ba libundu ba bakulu, baka hwa nde bebele na ba banyatihi.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Ni me Pahuli, musalili a Yisu Kristo, ndi mu utsonehele benu. Nzambi ateele me mu uba iluumbi, na nde asoolo me mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Umata beleve, Nzambi asiidi lahi bibaayaka Musamu wu Mubwe wunuwu, mu mimbihuli mya nde na mu Mabuuku ma Ngidi. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Musamu wu Mubwe mo wuuna, bibaayaka mu utala Mwana a nde Yisu Kristo, wu babuti mu bumuutu bwa nde, mu imbisa hya pfumu Davidi. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Mu Livupu la Ngidi, Nzambi asooli nde mu matwala ma nde ti nde bibaayaka Mwana a Nzambi, bu hasuuli nde ŋa hati la babakwa. Ni Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Ni mu tooni a Yisu, Nzambi haviidi me hyese hyuba iluumbi hya nde. Mu ubita baatu ba bibandu byosi, mana basiila nde imiinu na basiingala nde. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Benu kaka lili mu litangu la baatu mo bana, ba Yisu Kristo haateeli.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Me ndi mu utsonehele huli benu boosi ba lili hu Musyenge a Looma, benu ba Nzambi hatondo, ba nde hamiiteele mu uba bangidi. Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu, na Pfumu Yisu Kristo, bava benu hyese na hyenze.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na ba libundu ba hu Looma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Hati a tsomi, me ndi ufutala matondo huli Nzambi mu benu boosi, mu nduhi a Yisu Kristo. Mu tooni ati, bali mu utoyo mu imiinu hya benu mu toto yoosi. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nzambi wu me ndi mu utsalila mu mutima a me woosi, mu uyabisa benu Musamu wu Mubwe wu bibaayaka mu utala Mwana a nde, yaabi ti me ndi mu undeele imbuli: Me a umbakolo mu utangula benu ve. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Tangu yoosi yi me umbaatsambila, me ndi mu upondo huli Nzambi ti, tso liina ni litondo la nde, me kuhasa nlahi bibaayaka uyamono benu. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ka me na lehemene bibaayaka uyamono benu, mana Nzambi ava benu bungodu bu Livupu la Ngidi, mu uhwadisa imiinu hya benu. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Buuve, hufulili bubwe ti, me na lehemene bibaayaka uba ŋa hati la benu, mana liyakaani kwadisili mu itwadi. Kwadisili a benu mu imiinu hya me, na kwadisili a me, mu imiinu hya benu. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Baana ba ngu, me tondi ti benu liyaaba ti, me umbamba na matsimi ma uya huli benu. Ka natee bunuubu, me a hambaha nzila ve. Me na nzala ati isalu hya me hibuta mbutu huli benu kaka, we bu hyo hyabuta mbutu mu bibandu bikima. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Me ndi muutu wu afwana uyalongese huli baatu boosi: huli biyedi na huli ba bavele buyedi, huli babaayiha na ba baveleyiha muhanda. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi na lehemene bibaayaka uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli benu kaka, ba lili hu Musyenge a Looma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matwala ma Musamu wu Mubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Me a handi na tsonyi mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe ve, mu tooni ati, Musamu wu mubwe ni matwala ma Nzambi ali mu usalila, mu uyobolo pasi nde wu bibaayaka mu usiila nde imiinu. Hati a tsomi mu Bayudaayo, titswene mu Bangeleke. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Mu mbuli, Musamu wu Mubwe bibaayaka mu umweese bunuubu: Nzambi ubatsikaha butsiitsa bwa baatu, mu taangu yi bo bali mu usa hiitu mu nde, we bu basonehe mu Libuuku la Ngidi: «Mutsiitsa uba moonyi mu imiinu.»<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba bubanyanza Nzambi na Mikele mya nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="PSA 81:12-13">Mkg 81.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:9-20">Esa 44.9-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Umata hu yulu, Nzambi ubamweese kesi a nde huli baatu ba bubaveleyusa nde na ba bubaavaanga ma mabi. Bo bali mu upfubaha imbuli mu ngaabi a bo. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ni mu buuna, mambu ma mbuli ma buutwala uyaaba mu Nzambi, mali ma maayaluha ŋa busu bwa bo: ni Nzambi nde mwakulu amweesi bo lo paayalala. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Mu tooni ati, umata bu Nzambi havangi tsi, mbiili a nde yi yibavelemonehele, yi yili matwala ma nde ma nzyeni, na bu nde ali, bibamonehele mu mavaanga ma nde. Ni mu buuna, bo utwala uleele ve ti, bo a bayaabi ve. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Bo bayaabi Nzambi. Ka bo a bubakiinza nde ve, na bo a bubayusa nde we bu hwafwana ve. Bo bamiidunga hutso matsimi ma maavele lisuunga, na mitima mya bo, mi myavele buyedi, myamiisohomo hutso a pipidi. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Bo bali mu ubinuha ti bo na buyedi, ka bo bamiiyama maladi. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Ŋa mbuha uva muyusu huli Nzambi wu avelekwa, bo bubakunda bifwita, bifwaani bya baatu ba bubakwa, banyunyi, banyama ba miilu mina, na banyama ba bubayene mu bali. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi havahuli bo hutso a tsumihili, we bu huli linyungi bibaayaka mitima mya bo, mana bo basumana nyutu a bo, bomo na bomo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Bo bubasobo imbuli hya Nzambi mu mapfuta, bo bubakunda na bubaasalila mavaanga ma Nzambi ŋa mbuha Muvaangi a tsi, wu bu baayuusa mu bilima na bilima. Amen!<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi hayeholo bo mu ubaavaanga ma tsumihili. Bakadi ba bo, a bali mu ubwepfuuta taangi na balumi ba bo ve, buuna bo ubapfuuta taangi aka bomo na bomo bakaasu. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Bumosi kaka huli babahala, bo a bali mu ubwepfuuta taangi na bakadi ba bo ve. Bo bali na peyu yindahi mu upfuuta taangi bomo na bomo babahala. Maana mavaanga ma tsonyi bo bali mu usa, na bo bali mu uyaka tsyembili yi yaayelemene mu udunga hwa bo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Bu bo babisi uyaaba Nzambi, Nzambi atiimbi bo ŋa busu bu buyedi bwa bo bu bwadunga, na bo bali mu uvanga ma maavelefwana. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Bo bamiiluula mu vele bibaayaka butsiitsa bwa pila mu pila, mu bubi, linyungi, bukanyi; bo baluula mu nyengi, mu ndubili a baatu, mu midiingu, mu ubavahula bana, mu mitsotso, mu dyeele, mu mavaanga ma tsumihili. Bo bubakusa bana mu upfuta. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Bo bubakuta mapfuundu mu bana. Bo bali baboho ba Nzambi, banga lisabu, banga a ngaabi, banga nyeme. Bo batondo ubabuta ma mabi, bo bubakakana na bikuta bya bo. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Bo bali ba bavele na buyedi, bo a bubakuhasa malahi ma bo ve, bo bali na mitima mi minono, lingebe mu bana ve. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Bo bayaabi we bu hwafwana, kesili a Nzambi. Baatu ba bubaasalila buuna, bahwama na lipfu. Ka bo bali mu usupaha ubaavaanga ma pila mo yiina, na titswene, bo bali mu usilasa kaka bavangi ba ma mabi.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tsundusu butsiitsa ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ni mu buuna, pasi wu we bibaayaka, we wu ubatsundasa bana, we utwala uleele ve ti we a hayaabi ve. Bu we ubatsundasa bana, we bibaayaka mu usyembe we mwakulu. Mu tooni ati, we wu ubatsundasa bana, we kaka ubaavaanga ma mabi we bo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:5">2Sa 12.5</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Bisu liyaabi ti Nzambi ubatsundasa mu imbuli hyoosi, baatu ba bubaavaanga ma pila yiina. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />We wu bibaayaka mu utsundasa ba bubaavaanga ma mabi, ka we bibaayaka mu uvanga bumosi we bo! Mu we ti we upeke tsundusu a Nzambi? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Buuve, we bubwe bu bunene bwa Nzambi ubapenye, mu mukami a nde na bunene bu mutima a nde? We a hayabi ve ti bubwe bwa Nzambi buli mu ubita we hu usobo mbiili?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:18">Esa 30.18</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ka mu tooni a kamini mutima a we, we a hasobo mbiili ve. Buuna, we bibaayaka mu ukuukaha ŋa yulu a we mwakulu kesi yinene, mu ilumbu hi Nzambi humweese kesi a nde, na tsundusu a nde ya tsiitsa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Ilumbu mo hiina, Nzambi usyende muutu muutu we bu huli mavaanga ma nde.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:10">Yel 17.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:2-19">31.2-19</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Nzambi uva moonyi wu bilima na bilima huli ba bali na mukonono wu ubaavaanga mambu ma mabwe. Bo bali mu usaha muyusu, likiinzu na idiingu hi hyuvelekwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ka Nzambi umweese kesi na ifwefwe hya nde, huli boosi ba bubaatunala nde na ba bubasiila nde kene. Mbiili mo yiina, yibatelemene imbuli na yibasingasala mavaanga ma mabi. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Mapasi na minyongi byubwila boosi ba bubaasalila bubi. Hati a tsomi Bayudaayo, titswene ba bavele Bayudaayo! <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ka Nzambi uva muyusu, likiinzu na hyenze huli pasi nde wu ubaasalila mavaanga ma mabwe. Hati a tsomi Bayudaayo, titswene ba bavele Bayudaayo!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:7">2Mi 19.7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:19">Yob 34.19</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi a hubasa buraandu mu baatu ve.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Boosi ba bubasumaha hwavele uyaaba Mikele mya Moose, buunyambana tso bu baveleyaaba Mikele mo miina. Ka boosi ba bayaabi Mikele na bubasumaha, buutsundasa bo mu Mikele mo miina. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ni mu buuna, a ba bali mu uyuha Mikele bali ba bakuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi ve, ka ni ba bali mu usalila myo, buuba ba bakuha. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ŋa Bangoyi ba baveleyaba Mikele mya Nzambi, bubaasalila myo mu bo mwakulu, bo boosi we ba bali na myo hutso mitima mya bo, tso bu bo baveleyaba myo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Mu mbiili a bo yiina, bo bali mu umweese ti mavaanga ma Mikele mili mu utuma, basonehe mutso mitima mya bo. Tsikihili a bo yi misamu, yili mu uta imbangi. Ni bumosi kaka, matsimi ma mitima mya bo, mubakese bo, buuve mubavolele bo mileembe. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Maana ni ma mu umonehele, ilumbu hi Nzambi huutsundasa matswehi ma pasi muutu, mu nduhi a Yisu Kristo, we bu Musamu wu Mubwe wu me ndi mu unzabisa ali mu umweese.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiili Bayudaayo ŋa busu bu Mikele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ka we wu bibaayaka mu ubula mabyoho ti we Muyudaayo, we bibaayaka mu usiingama mu Mikele na we bibaayaka mu unyeme ti Nzambi, Nzambi a we. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />We yaabi litondo la Nzambi, na Mikele mili mu ulongese we mu usoolo ma mabwe ma muutu huutwala uvanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />We bibaayaka mu umonehele ti, we ni mubiti binzimana wu bibaayaka mu ulaha bo nzila. We bibaayaka mu umonehele ti, we ni liyalala la ba bali mu piipidi. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />We bibaayaka mu umonehele ti, we mulongisi a ba bavele na nzaabili, muyihisi bibabana. Eye, we bibaayaka na hiitu ti hutso Mikele, we ubaha nzaabili na imbuli! <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Ni mu buuna, we wu bibaayaka mu ulongese bakima, mu hima we avelelongese we mwakulu? We wu bibaayaka mu uyabisa bana ti uyiba ve, mu hima we bibaayaka mu uyiba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />We wu bibaayaka mu uleele ti mayamba usa ve, mu hima we bibaayaka mu usa mayamba? We wu bibaayaka mu ubelele bifwita, mu hima we bibaayaka mu uyiba bisiha bi bili mu manzo ma nzambi ma bifwita? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />We wu bibaayaka mu ubinuha ti we na Mikele mya Moose, we bibaayaka mu umweese Nzambi tsonyi mu tooni ati, we bibaayaka mu uvanga ma maasobono na ma Mikele mili mu utuma! <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ni mu buuna, Mabasonehe mali mu uleele: «Ni mu tooni a benu Bayudaayo, bangoyi bali mu ukwede nduhi a Nzambi.»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Esa 52.5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:23">Ezk 36.23</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ketili ya mbuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Mu mbuli, ketili yili na tsongo mu we, tso we bibaayaka mu usalila Mikele. Ka tso we bibaayaka mu utsoopolo Mikele, hu bibaayaka mu umweese ti we kini a bakete ve. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Tso muutu wu bavelekete bibaayaka mu usalila Mikele mya Nzambi, Nzambi utwala usiinga nde we muutu wu bamiikete ve? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Muutu wu bavelekete mu musunya, ka ubasiingala Mikele, utsundasa we, we wu bibaayaka mu usumana Mikele, tso bu we ayaaba mikele mibasonehe tso bu we bibaayaka wu bakete. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ni mu buuna, Muyudaayo wa mbuli, a ni wu ubamonehele ŋa miisu ma baatu ti nde Muyudaayo ve, na wu bibaayaka na iliimbu hya ketili mu musunya a nde ve. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ka Muyudaayo wa mbuli ni wu bibaayaka wa mu tswehi, wu bakete hutso mutima, mu ketili yi Livupu la Nzambi, kini a yi basonehe mu Mikele ve. Muyudaayo wa mbuli, ni nde wuuna wu ubayaka muyusu wu ubamata huli Nzambi, ka a huli baatu ve.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:16">Pfu 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:4">Yel 4.4</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Buuna, Muyudaayo mu ki lo hakulala baatu bakima? Buuve, kaluha a ketili ni hima? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Eye! Kaluha yili hwa yo yinene. Mu tooni ati, hati a tsomi, ni huli Bayudaayo Nzambi haviidi mambu ma nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:19">Mkg 147.19</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Mu mbuli, tso Bayudaayo bakima babisi usa imiinu. Pelili a bo imiinu, utwala ufwinzala butsiitsa bwa Nzambi? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ubila ve! Bisu laafwana uyaaba ti Nzambi bibaayaka mbuli, na baatu boosi bali bapfuti, we bu Mabasonehe mali mu uleele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Baatu bafwana utsikaha ti mu taangu yi we bibaayaka mu utoyo, we bibaayaka mu uleele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">Na tso batsundisi we, we afwana ubiinga<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:11">Mkg 116.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:6">Mkg 51.6</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ka tso bubi bu bisu libasa, buli mu umweese ti mbuli Nzambi bibaayaka tsiitsa, buni luutwala uleele? Ti Nzambi a hali tsiitsa ve, ŋa nde ali mu unyangumasa kesi a nde ŋa yulu a bisu – Tso me ndi mu undeele buuna, maana ni matsimi ma me ma imuutu – <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Naana! Tso nde a hali tsiitsa ve, buni nde huutsundasa baatu ba tsi?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Ka tso mapfuta ma me mali mu umweese paayalala imbuli hya Nzambi mu muyusu a nde, mu hima buubwetsundasa me we musumihi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Mu hima luuveleleele ti: «Lisaani ma mabi, mana mo makituha ma mabwe?» Baatu bakima mu utoyo bubi mu bisu, bali mu uleele ti maana mambu ma me. Baatu mo baana bahwama na tsyembili.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutsiitsa tso mumosi ndeve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Ka hima? Be bisu Bayudaayo, bisu laakulala bakima? Naana! Bisu laamiimweese ti baatu boosi, Bayudaayo na ba bavele Bayudaayo, bali hutso lituma bibaayaka masumu. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uyabisa bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">«A huli na muutu wu akuha ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">tso mumosi ve,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />a huli na muutu tso mumosi wu bibaayaka iyedi ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:11">a huli na tso mumosi wu bibaayaka mu usaha Nzambi ve.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Baatu boosi bamiidunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">bo boosi mu itwadi, baaka na mbiili yi yaafulala bubi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">A huli na muutu tso mumosi wu ubasa lilibwe ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">tso mumosi a hali ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Mkg 14.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:2-4">53.2-4</ref></char></note>!<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Mivodi mya bo myaka we ngila ya bwasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">limi la bo libasoho bana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">mu bibodu bya bo, ubaapala myangala mya pili<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:10">Mkg 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:4">Mkg 140.4</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Minywa mya bo myaluula mu mambu ma tsingiili</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:14">na ma kali.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Miilu mya bo myaleenge mu utsolese makila.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Bo bali mu utsala na usiisa mapasi kadi tsyelo yi bo bali mu uvyoho.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Bo a bayabi nzila a hyenze ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Esa 59.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:16">Mak 1.16</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Bo a bubakiinza Nzambi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:2">Mkg 36.2</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Ka bisu liyabi ti, mambu moosi ma mali mu Mikele mya Nzambi, mubasiingama huli ba Nzambi haviidi Mikele mya nde. Mana minywa myosi mikangama, na bayaaba ti baatu ba toto yoosi, bali na tooni ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ka muutu tso mumosi utwala uba wu akuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi ve, bu nde huvaanga moosi ma Mikele mili mu utuma. Mu tooni ati, nzaabili masumu ubaya mu nzila mavaanga ma Mikele.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imiinu mu Yisu Kristo hibakuhasa muutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ka bunuubu, Nzambi amiimweese buni nde ubakuhasa bisu ŋa busu bwa nde, hwavele usalila Mikele. Mabuuku ma Mikele na ma mimbihuli mu baasilisi lo. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nzambi ubakuhasa baatu butsiitsa, mu nzila yi imiinu hya bo mu Yisu Kristo. Nde ubaavanga buuna, mu boosi ba bali usa imiinu mu Kristo, mu tooni ati, lisobosono love ŋa hati la bo: <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />boosi bamiisa masumu na bamiivinda ukoto mu muyusu a Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ka mu bungodu, Nzambi amiikuhasa bo mu hyese hya nde, mu likumbasa bibaayaka liyobolo bibaayaka lili mu Kristo Yisu. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Ni nde Nzambi hayehuli we bungodu, mu ufwinzala mu makila ma nde, masumu ma boosi ba bubasiila nde imiinu. Nzambi havangi buuna, mu umweese butsiitsa bwa nde, mu tooni ati, mu taangu a tsomi, nde a hasyembi baatu mu masumu ma bo ve. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Mu mukami a nde, Nzambi tondi umweese butsiitsa bwa nde mu taangu mo yiniiyi, mana nde aba wa tsiitsa na ukuhasa pasi muutu wu amiisiila Yisu imiinu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Tooni mabyoho ma bisu ka kiyo? Naana! Yove tso mosi! Bisu libaleele buuna mu ki tooni? Mu tooni ati hya tsoongo, ni uvelebweba hu tsina lituma bibaayaka mavaanga ma Mikele, ka mu usa imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Mu mbuli bisu lili mu usilasa ti, Nzambi ubakuhasa muutu mu tooni imiinu hya nde, ka a mu mavaanga ma Mikele ve. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Buuve, Nzambi ndulu Nzambi Bayudaayo ali? Nde a hali kaka Nzambi bangoyi ve? Eye! Nde bibaayaka kaka Nzambi bangoyi, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />mu tooni ati, Nzambi ndulu mosi ali! Ni nde ukuhasa ba bakete mu imiinu, na ba bavelekete mu imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Ka buuna butondi uleele ti bisu ka tsoongo Mikele luufwinzala mu ukiisa imiinu? Naana! Ka bisu Mikele lili mu usilasa.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ifwaani hi imiinu hya Abrahami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Buuna, hima bisu luuleele mu Abrahami kaaha a bisu mu musunya? Hima nde habahi? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Tso Nzambi asiingi ti Abrahami bibaayaka wu akuha mu tooni mavaanga, Abrahami utwala ubula mabyoho. Ka a ŋa busu bwa Nzambi ve. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Eye! Mabasonehe ma Ngidi buni mu uleele: «Abrahami asiidi imiinu mu Nzambi, na Nzambi asiingi ti nde bibaayaka wu akuha mu imiinu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Mba 15.6</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Woosi wu ubasala, ubayaka pfuta a nde. Pfuta mo, a yili huli nde we hyese ve, ka yo yili mukanu. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ka ŋa muutu wu avelesa isalu, ali na hiitu mu Nzambi wu ubakitusa nga masumu wu akuha, Nzambi miisiinga ti nde wu akuha ali mu imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Ni bumosi kaka, Davidi bibaayaka mu uyabisa kinya yi yili na muutu wu Nzambi ubasiinga ti nde wu akuha ali, hwavele utala mavaanga ma nde:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />«Kinya yili huli baana, ba Nzambi hamiisa kolo-kolo mu ma mabi ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">na ba masumu ma bo bamiinyahula!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Kinya yili huli muutu wu Pfumu havelesiinga lisumu la nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Mkg 32.1-2</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Kinya mo yiina, ndulu ya ba bali Bayudaayo, vo ti, yo yili kaka yi bangoyi? Mu mbuli, bisu libaleele ti: «Nzambi asiingi ti Abrahami wu akuha ali, mu tooni imiinu hya nde.» <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Mu ki taangu musamu mo wuuna hatswihi? Tehele bakete Abrahami, buuve humbisa a ketili a nde? Naana! A humbisa a ketili a nde ve, ka ŋa habedi kini a baketi ve. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Na titswene, Abrahami ayaki ketili we iliimbu. Hyo hyaba we matala mu umweese ti Nzambi asiingi ukuha hwa nde mu imiinu. Ni buuna, bu Abrahami haba kini a baketi ve, Nzambi abyalisi nde taata a boosi ba bubasiila imiinu mu Nzambi. Baatu mo baana, Nzambi ubasiinga bo kaka we ba bakuha, tso bu bo babeedi kini a baketi ve. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Nde bibaayaka kaka taata a ba bakete, ka a ba bubabingalala ndulu ketili ve, ka ba bubaduukala ifwaani hi imiinu hya taata a bisu Abrahami, bu haba kini a baketi ve.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lahi la Nzambi huli ba bubasa imiinu mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi asiidi lahi huli Abrahami na imbisa hya nde, ti bo sa babyalila tsi. Lahi mo liina basiidi lo, a mu tooni ati Abrahami asiingili Mikele ve, ka mu tooni ati, Nzambi asiingi ti nde bibaayaka wu akuha mu imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Tso ubyalila hwa tsi hu basa lahi, bali mu ubyalila yo mu lisiingala bibaayaka Mikele, buuna imiinu hikiiba hi hyavele a kaluha, na lahi la Nzambi likiiba bibaayaka laavele a tsoongo. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Mikele mibateele kesi a Nzambi. Ka ŋa hwavele Mikele, kene mu Mikele ka yove.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ni mu buuna, basiidi lahi mu nzila yi imiinu, mana hyo hiba hyese hi Nzambi ubava, na basilasa hyo huli imbisa hya Abrahami hyoosi. Lahi a lili mu utala ndulu ba bubasiingala Mikele ve, ka napa boosi ba bubasa imiinu we bu Abrahami hasiidi imiinu. Abrahami ni taata a bisu boosi, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />we bu Mabasonehe mali mu uleele: «Me atsoolo we taata mabuli ma malahi ma baatu ba tsi.» Nde bibaayaka taata a bisu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi wu nde ubasiila imiinu, Nzambi wu ubafutala moonyi huli babakwa na wu ubatsunda bi byavele. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Tooni yi ubwesa hiitu aba aka yove, ka Abrahami asiidi hwa nde hiitu. «Nde akituhi kaaha mabuli ma malahi ma baatu.» Nde asiidi imiinu mu Nzambi, we bu Nzambi haleeli nde: «Buuna ni bu huba litangu bibaayaka imbisa hya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Mba 15.5</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Abrahami aba aka bebele a kama (100) bibaayaka bilima. Ka imiinu hya nde hyaba a hyakolo ve, bu nde hakatsima ti linyutu la nde aba laaka bebele na lipfu, na mukadi a nde Sara wu akiibwevelebuta. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ŋa busu bwa lahi la Nzambi, Abrahami a habwisi hiitu hya nde na usa paha ve. Imiinu hya nde hyahwadisi nde, na nde ayusi Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Nde aba na tadi ti Nzambi na matwala ma ukuhasa ma nde hasiidi lahi. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ni mu buuna, bubaleele mu Abrahami ti, mu tooni imiinu hya nde, «Nzambi asiingi ti nde wu akuha.»<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Mikuma mo miniimi: «Nzambi ubasiinga Abrahami, muutu wu akuha», a mu tooni a Abrahami siha basonehe ve. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Baasonehe mikuma mo miina kaka mu bisu. Bisu ba buusiinga ti imiinu hya bisu hili hi hyakuha, mu tooni ati libasa imiinu mu Nzambi wu asuuli Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu, ŋa hati la babakwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Nzambi aviidi Yisu mu lipfu, mu tooni masumu ma bisu. Na Nzambi asuuli nde, mana bisu liba ba bakuha.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Hyenze hya na Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ni mu buuna, bu bisu laaka ba tsiitsa mu imiinu, bisu lili mu hyenze na Nzambi mu likumbasa la Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Mu tooni imiinu hya bisu mu nde, bisu lili na muswa mu ubaha hyese hi bisu luukwilala ba bavangama mu hyo. Na bisu lili na kinya, bu bisu lili na hiitu mu ukabasana muyusu a Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ŋa yulu a ŋaana, bisu lili mu kinya mutso minyongi, bu liyaabi ti minyongi mibabuta mukonono, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />mukonono ubabuta kwadisili mutso malobese, na kwadisili yibabuta hiitu. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Hiitu a hibapfuta ve mu tooni ati, Nzambi ayitili litondo la nde mutso mitima mya bisu, mu likumbasa bibaayaka Livupu la Ngidi bibaayaka nde haviidi bisu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ni mu buuna, bu bisu laaba kini mifudi ve, Kristo akwidi mu tooni a bisu banga masumu, mu taangu yi Nzambi hakese. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Hu bibaayaka pasi mu usiinga ukwa mu tooni a muutu wu asungama! Peleve muutu utwala uba na ibahala, mu ukwa mu tooni a muutu wu mubwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ka mono buni Nzambi hamweesi bunene bu litondo la nde mu bisu: ŋa bisu laaba kini banga masumu, Kristo akwidi mu tooni a bisu.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Tso ni mbuli bisu laaka ba bakuha mu makila ma Kristo, ni ti nde ufuuhasa bisu kaka mu kesi a Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Bu bisu laaba baboho ba Nzambi, nde anoongi na bisu mu lipfu la mwana a nde. Tandisini a buunubu bu bisu limiinoongo na Nzambi, buni nde huvelefuhasa bisu mu moonyi a mwana a nde? <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Titswene, bisu lili na kinya ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu tooni a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, wu miinongese bisu loloyi na Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adami ifwafwani hya Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Ni mu buuna, lisumu laakoti mu tsi mu tooni a muutu mumosi, na lo laabehi lipfu. Ni bumosi kaka, lipfu laakotilili baatu boosi, mu tooni ati boosi basumihi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Tehele Nzambi ava Mikele mya nde huli Moose, masumu maatswamini mu tsi. Ka bu Mikele myaba kini myove, mu taangu mo yiina, Nzambi a hakataanga masumu ve. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ka lipfu laakasasa umata taangu a Adami natee ya Moose. Lipfu laakasasa naapa mu baatu ba bakavelesa masumu we ma Adami, wu avelikiinza ma Nzambi haleeli nde. Adami ni ifwafwani hya nde wuuna wu akiiya.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ka lisumu la Adami, a luuyelemese na hyese hi Nzambi ubava mu bungodu ve. Mu mbuli, baatu ba balahi bamiikwa mu tooni bubi bwa muutu mumosi. Ka bubwe bu Nzambi ubamweese mu baatu, bwafulala iteesi. Na bi nde ubava bi bungodu huli baatu ba balahi mu likumbasa la muutu mumosi, Yisu Kristo, byamiisinzafulala. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Na bi Nzambi ubava, a byuyelemese na lisumu la muutu mumosi ve. Tsundusu a Nzambi mu tooni lisumu la muutu mumosi, Adami, yaabiti baatu hu tsyembili. Ka bungodu bwa hyese hya Nzambi, bwabiti baatu mu uba bunyanga, tso yuhili bubi bwa bo bu bwafulala. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Mu mbuli, lipfu laamweesi matwala ma lo mu lisumu la muutu mumosi. Ka mu Yisu Kristo siha, bisu laamiiyaka bi bilahi: boosi ba bali mu uyaka hyese hi hyafulala hya Nzambi, na bungodu bu butsiitsa bwa nde, buuba moonyi na buuba batumi na Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ni ŋaana, lisumu la muutu mumosi, Adami, laabiti baatu boosi mu kondaayi. Ni bumosi kaka, vanga la tsiitsa limosi la Yisu Kristo, luubita baatu boosi mu uba bunyanga na uva bo moonyi. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />We mu kene a muutu mumosi, baatu ba balahi basumihi. Ni bumosi kaka, mu lisiingala la muutu mumosi, baatu ba balahi baka bunyanga ŋa busu bwa Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Mikele myayidi mu umweese baatu masumu ma bo, na masumu maafulili bulahi. Ka huuna hu masumu maafulili, hyese hya Nzambi hyabwesinzafulala. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />We bu lisumu laamweesi matwala mu uduba baatu, ni bumosi kaka, hyese hya Nzambi hyumweese matwala ma hyo mu butsiitsa, mu ubita baatu hu moonyi wu bilima na bilima mu Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwa mu masumu, uba moonyi mu Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Buuna hima luleelaani? Bisu a benu likwilalaani mu usa masumu, mana hyese hya Nzambi hisinzafulala iteesi? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Naana ubila ve! Bisu ti laamiikwa mu masumu, ka buni lutwala ubweba moonyi mu masumu? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Benu a liyaabi ve ti, bisu boosi ba laayaki tondihili mu Yisu Kristo, ni mu lipfu la nde batondihi bisu? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Mu tondihili mo yiina yi lipfu, badiihi bisu kaka na nde. We bu Kristo hasuuhi mu babakwa mu muyusu a Taata, ni bumosi kaka, bisu luudyata mu moonyi wu munyatihi mu nde.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ni mu buuna, tso bisu laaba itwadi na nde mu lipfu bibaayaka laafwanina na la nde, bumosi kaka, bisu luuba itwadi na nde mu tsuuhili yi yafwanina na ya nde. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ni mu buuna, liyabani ti, imuutu hya bisu a benu hya tsikulu bakomini hyo ŋa muti itwadi na Kristo. Mana itwadi hya bisu na masumu hitabuha, na libwevelebani baviha ba masumu. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Mu tooni ati, muutu wu miikwa itwadi na Kristo, aka wu akuha, na amiitahuha na masumu. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Tso bisu a benu laakwa mu Kristo, bisu lili na hiitu ti bisu sa liba kaka moonyi na nde. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Bu liyaabi ti Kristo wu asuuhi ŋa hati la babakwa a hubwekwa ve, lipfu a lisaali na matwala ŋa yulu a nde ve. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Mu lipfu la nde, nde akwidi kwa limosi mu tooni masumu ma baatu. Ka bunuubu, nde bibaayaka moonyi, na nde bibaayaka moonyi mu Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ni bumosi kaka mu benu, yaabaani ti, benu lili baatu babakwa mu masumu. Na ti, benu lili kaka moonyi mu Nzambi itwadi na Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ni mu buuna, masumu utwala ubwetuma nyutu a benu yi yukwa ve, mu ubwesiingala linyungi la yo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />A liyeholo linyutu la benu mu masumu we bilwanili bi uvanga ma mabi ve. Ka yeholwaani nyutu a benu mwakulu huli Nzambi, we baatu ba moonyi ba bamiimata hutso lipfu. Na yeholwaani linyutu la benu loosi mu isalu hya Nzambi, we ilwanili hi uvanga mambu ma butsiitsa. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Buuna, lisumu a lubweba na matwala mu benu ve. Mu tooni ati, benu a lili hutso lituma bibaayaka Mikele ve, ka hutso a hyese hya Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usala mu butsiitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Ka buni? Bisu a benu ni libasumahani mu tooni ati a lisaali hutso Mikele ve, ka hutso a hyese hya Nzambi? Naana ubila ve! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Benu liyaabi lo bubwe: tso benu lisalili muutu na usiingala nde we baviha, benu lika baviha ba pfumu wu benu lili mu usiingala. Tso hwaba lisumu bibaayaka libabita hu lipfu, buuve lisiingala bibaayaka libabita hu moonyi wu butsiitsa. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ka lifutalaani matondo huli Nzambi! Benu ba laabeedi hu tsikulu baviha ba masumu, bunuubu benu limiisiingala mu mutima woosi Mikele mya ndongisili yi benu laayaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Na bunuubu, bu benu limiiyoboho mu masumu, benu ka baviha ba mavaanga ma butsiitsa. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Me ndi mu unzambila mu imuutu, mana benu litsikaha ma me ndi ndeele. Ni bumosi kaka, benu layehuli binama bya benu mu buviha bu manzala ma bubembo, na bubi bu buli mu ubita muutu mu utuumbaha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Ni bumosi kaka, bunuubu,vaani linyutu la benu loosi mu buviha bu mavaanga ma butsiitsa, mu uba mu idiingu hi bungidi.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ka ŋa benu laaba kini baviha ba masumu, benu laaba bunyanga ŋa busu bwa mambu ma butsiitsa. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ka benu ki kaluha laabahi mu taangu mo yiina? Mavaanga ma benu lili na tsonyi mu mo loloyi. Mavaanga mo maana, tsukusu a mo ni lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ka bunuubu, bu lika bunyanga ŋa busu bu masumu, na bu lika baviha ba Nzambi, kaluha yi benu luubaha ni idiingu hi hyaluula mu nde, na tsukusu ni moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ka pfuta a masumu ni lipfu, ka ikuuku hi Nzambi ubava mu bungodu, ni moonyi wu bilima na bilima itwadi na Yisu Kristo, Pfumu a bisu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mukristo aka bunyanga ŋa busu bu Mikele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Baana ba ngu, benu laamiikwayaaba ti, mikele mili na matwala ŋa yulu a muutu ndulu ŋa nde akini moonyi, mu tooni ati benu laayaba Mikele. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Ni mu buuna, Mikele mibamweese ti mukaasu wu bakwele akangama na mulumi a nde, bu mulumi akini moonyi. Ka tso mulumi kwidi, mukaasu ka bunyanga ŋa busu bu mukele wu kapfuuta nde na mulumi. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Tso ŋa mulumi a nde akini moonyi, nde aba mukadi a bahala likima, nde sa aba mukaasu mayamba. Ka tso mulumi a nde kwidi, nde ka bunyanga ŋa busu bu mukele. Na nde uba mukadi a bahala likima, hwavele uba mukaasu mayamba. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ni bumosi kaka benu bana ba ngu a me, benu lamiikwa ŋa busu bu Mikele bu lili itwadi na nyutu a Kristo. Ka bunuubu benu laaka ba muutu mukima, nde wuuna wu asuuhi ŋa hati la babakwa, mana bisu a benu libutaani mbutu yimbwe ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Eye, ŋa bisu laaba hutso lituma bibaayaka imuutu, manzaala ma mabi ma Mikele myakatuma, maakabasala mutso linyutu la bisu loosi, mana bisu lisala bisalu bi byubita bisu hu lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ka bunuubu, bisu a benu lika bunyanga ŋa busu bu Mikele, mu tooni ati, bisu lili we babakwa ŋa busu bu Mikele mi myakakotese bisu mu buviha. Mana bisu lisalila Nzambi hutso lituma bibaayaka linyatihi bibaayaka Livupu. Ka a husaali hutso lituma la tsikulu bibaayaka mikele mibasonehe ve.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matwala ma lisumu na ma Mikele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Buuna, hima luleelaani ti Mikele ni lisumu? Naana ubila ve! Ka Mikele ni mimyayabisi me lisumu ni hima. Mumbuli, me a hakiinzaaba linyungi ve, tso Mikele a myaleeli ve ti: «We a hanyungala ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Pal 20.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Pfu 5.21</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ka bu lisumu lasiingama mu Mikele, lo libabutala me manzaala moosi ma mabi. Ni mu buuna, hwavele Mikele, lisumu la miikwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Mu taangu a tsikulu, hwavele Mikele, me ambeedi moonyi. Ka bu Mikele myayamonehele, lisumu bibaayaka miibwebaha moonyi, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />na me amiikwa. Na ma maayiila me, ni ti tumili yi yikiibita hu moonyi, yabita me hu lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Mu tooni ati, lisumu lasiingama mu tumili: lisumu laasoho me na laaduba me.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ni mu buuna, Mikele myomo mili mya ngidi, na tumili yili ya ngidi, ya tsiitsa na yi mbwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Buni? Tumili yi yili yimbwe yimiikituha tooni lipfu la me? Naana! Ni lisumu lili tooni lipfu la me, mu usalila ma mabwe. Ni mu buuna, Mikele myasa ti bisu liyaaba buni lisumu laafulala bisiha byosi mu bubi.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Eye, bisu liyaabi ti Mikele ubamata mu Livupu la Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s2" vid="ROM 7:14">Mudiingu wa hutso mutima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:14">Ka me, me ndi muutu wu akolo wu bamiisumbasa we muviha mu lisumu.<verse eid="ROM 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Me a humbatsikaha ma me ndi mu upanga ve. Mambu ma me umbaatondo, me a mbatsalila mo ve, ka mambu ma me ambele, ni maana ma me umbapanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Tso me umbapanga mambu ma me aveletondo, buuna me ndi mu utsiinga ti Mikele mili mi mibwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Bunuubu, a ni me ndi mu upanga buuna ve, ka ni lisumu bibaayaka lili mu me lili mu utuma me.<verse eid="ROM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ka me nzaabi ti, mambu ma mabwe mali mu imuutu hya me hi hyaakolo hiniihi. Eye, me na nzala uvanga mambu ma mabwe, ka me a handi na mifudi mi ukuhasa mo ve. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Eye, me a hambapanga mambu ma mabwe ma me umbaatondo ve, ka me umbapanga mambu ma mabi ma me aveletondo. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Tso me paangi ma me aveletondo, a me ndi mu upanga buuna ve, ka ni lisumu bibaayaka lili mu me, lili mu utuma me.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Me miitsikaha bunuubu: ŋa mbuha yi me tondi uvanga mambu ma mabwe, me ubaavaanga ndulu mambu ma mabi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Hutso matsimi ma mutima a me, me ndi na kinya mu matumili ma Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ka me ndi mu umono hutso linyutu la me, tumili kima yi yibalwanisa tumili yi buyedi bwa me bubasilasa. Yo yili mu ukitusa me kondaayi a mukele lisumu wu bibaayaka mu me. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Me ndi mu lingebe! Na uyobolo me mu linyutu mo liniili, bibaayaka lili mu ubita me hu lipfu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Lifutalaani matondo huli Nzambi mu Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Mu ukuka, mu buyedi bwa a me, me hu tsina lituma bibaayaka Mikele mya Nzambi me ndi, ka mu ikolili hi imuutu hya me, me ndi muviha a mukele lisumu.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Udyata mu Livupu la Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Bunuubu, boosi ba babaambana na Yisu Kristo a bubweyaka tsyembili ve. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Mu tooni ati, mukele a Livupu la Ngidi wu ubava moonyi mu likumbasa la Yisu Kristo, amiiva me bunyanga ŋa busu bu mukele lisumu na lipfu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Mambu ma Mikele mya Moose myakaveletwala uvanga, mu tooni ikolili hi bumuutu, Nzambi avangi mo. Nde atsindihi Mwana a nde mu uba moonyi mu linyutu bibaayaka musunya, mana nde amaasa mukele lisumu, na uva lisumu tsyembili mutso a nyutu. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Nzambi hasiidi buuna, mana nde akuhasa mambu moosi ma butsiitsa ma Mikele mili mu utuma bisu. Mambu mo maana, maafwana uvangama mu bisu ba laabweveledyata mu matsimi ma imuutu, ka ba lili mu udyata mu Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Eye, ba bali mu udyata mu matsimi ma imuutu, bo bubaasalila manzala ma musunya, ka ba bali moonyi mu Livupu la Ngidi, bali mu usalila manzala ma Livupu. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Manzala ma musunya mubabita hu lipfu. Ka usalila manzala ma Livupu, hubava moonyi na hyenze. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Boosi ba bali hu tsina lituma bibaayaka manzala ma imuutu, bali baboho ba Nzambi. Mu tooni ati, bo a bubasiingala Mikele mya Nzambi ve, na a bubatwala tso hoole ve. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Ni mu buuna, ba bali hu tsina lituma bibaayaka musunya, utwala umweese Nzambi kinya ve.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ka benu, benu a lili mu udyata hu tsina lituma bibaayaka musunya ve. Benu lili mu udyata mu Livupu la Nzambi, mu tooni ati, Livupu la Nzambi lili mu benu. Muutu wu avele na Livupu la Kristo, a hali wa nde ve. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Tso Kristo bibaayaka mu benu, nyutu a benu sa yikwa hwa yo mu tooni masumu, ka Livupu lili mu uva benu moonyi, mu tooni ati, bamiikitusa benu ba tsiitsa ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Tso Livupu la Nzambi, wuuna wu asuula Yisu ŋa hati la babakwa lili mu benu, Nzambi wuuna wu asuula Kristo ŋa hati la babakwa, sa ava kaka moonyi huli nyutu a benu yi yukwa mu Livupu la nde bibaayaka lili mu benu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ni mu buuna bana ba ngu, bisu a benu lili na mukanu. Ka a hali mukanu manzala ma linyutu mu udyata mu imuutu ve. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Mu tooni ati, tso benu lidyati mu manzala ma benu ma imuutu, benu sa likwa. Ka mu likumbasa bibaayaka Livupu la Ngidi, tso benu lidubi mavaanga ma mabi ma benu libasa mu nyutu a benu, benu sa liba moonyi. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ni mu buuna, baatu boosi ba Livupu la Nzambi libaasuungaha, bali bana ba Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Mu mbuli, Livupu bibaayaka benu laayaka, a lili livupu bibaayaka luukitusa benu baviha na bibaayaka luubweluusa benu mu boomo ve. Ka ni Livupu la Ngidi bibaayaka libamweese ti benu aka baana ba Nzambi, na bibaayaka libava bisu muswa mu ufulaha huli Nzambi: «Aba!» Mbindulili ti «Taata!» <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Livupu la Ngidi libata imbangi lo mwakulu huli livupu la bisu ti, bisu lili baana ba Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Eye, tso bisu lili baana ba Nzambi, bisu kaka ni babyalili ba mukobe! Eye! Babyalili ba mukobe a Nzambi. Mukobe wu luukabasana itwadi na Kristo. Ka tso bisu lili mu umono mapasi itwadi na Kristo, bisu kaka sa liba itwadi hutso muyusu a nde.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muyusu wa hu busu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Me ndi mu utsima ti, utwala uyelemese mapasi ma taangu mo yiniiyi na muyusu a hu busu, wu Nzambi humweese bisu paayalala ve. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ka byosi bi Nzambi havanga, bili mu ukeele na lehemene, taangu yi Nzambi humweese muyusu a baana ba nde. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Buuna byosi bi nzambi havanga, byaaka hu tsina matwala ma mifudi mi myavele a kaluha. Byo byaaka buuna, a ni mu litondo la byo mwakulu ve, ka mu litondo la Nzambi. Ka hiitu hili hwa hyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Hiitu ni ti, ilumbu Nzambi uva bunyanga mu bi nde havanga, mu buviha bu matwala ma mutsali a byo. Na byo sa bibaha muyusu wu bunyanga bwa baana ba Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ka, bisu liyaabi ti natee loloyi, byosi bi Nzambi havanga, bili mu ubima na umono pasi, we mukaasu nga misoongo. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ka ndulu a byosi bi Nzambi havanga bili mu ubima ve. Bisu kaka laaka na Livupu la Ngidi, we kabu latsomi bibaayaka bungodu bu Livupu bu Nzambi hasiidi lahi. Bisu kaka lili mu ubima hutso mitima, tswamina Nzambi akitusa bisu baana ba nde na uva bunyanga mu nyutu a bisu mu mapasi. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ka bisu lamiiyoboho ndulu mu hiitu. Bi muutu ali mu umono, utwala ubweba hiitu ve. Bi bali mu umono, utwala ubwesa hiitu mu byo? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ka tso bisu libasa hiitu mu bi laavelemono, bisu libakeele byo na isuusi hyoosi.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Bumosi kaka, Livupu la Ngidi libaya mu ukumbasa bisu, mu tooni ati, bisu lili na ikolili. Buuna, bisu a liyaabi usambila we bu hwafwana ve. Ka Livupu lo mwakulu libasambila Nzambi mu tooni a bisu, na nzayiini yi pasi muutu huveletwala uyabisa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Na Nzambi wu ubafundala idongi hi mitima, ubabangula ma Livupu la Ngidi ubatondo uvondo. Mu tooni ati, Livupu libasambila mu ba nde, we bu Nzambi ubatondo.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Bisu liyaabi ti, pasi bisiha bibavangama mu libwe la ba batondo Nzambi, na ba nde hateele we bu huli kesili a nde. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Buuna, mu baatu ba Nzambi hatswamini usoolo, nde atswamini uvolo kesili mu ufwanisa bo na Mwana a nde, mana nde aba pasa-bibelo ŋa hati la baana ba ngu ba balahi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Baatu ba Nzambi hatswamini usoolo, nde ateeli kaka bo. Ba nde haateeli, nde akitusi bo kaka ba butsiitsa ŋa busu bwa nde, ba nde hakitusi ba butsiitsa, nde aviidi bo kabu bibaayaka muyusu a nde.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunene bu litondo la Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Buuna hima lubwelelaani?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:31">Tso Nzambi bibaayaka wa bisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:31">na utwala uvanga bisu bibaayaka libi?<verse eid="ROM 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Nde wu avelitahula Mwana a nde mwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:32">ka nde ayehuli nde mu bisu boosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:32">buni nde huveleva bisu byosi itwadi na Mwana a nde?<verse eid="ROM 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Na uyakese ba Nzambi hasoolo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:33">Muutu ve! Mu tooni ati, Nzambi bibaayaka mu ukitusa bo ba butsiitsa.<verse eid="ROM 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ka na utwala usyembe bo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:34">Muutu ve, mu tooni ati, Yisu Kristo miikwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:34">titswene nde miisuuha, nde bibaayaka ŋa mbahala a Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:34">Na nde bibaayaka mu usambila mu bisu!<verse eid="ROM 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Na utwala utahula bisu na litondo la Kristo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:35">Mapasi, minyongi, mbingisili, nzala, pene, busisu vo lipfu?<verse eid="ROM 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />We bu Mabasonehe mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Mu tooni a we, bali mu uyeholo bisu mu lipfu pasi ilumbu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">bali mu uvolo bisu we mandombo ma bali mu ubita hu uhehe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:23">Mkg 44.23</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ka mu mambu mo maana moosi, bisu laafulala mbiingili mu tooni a nde wuuna wu atondo bisu.<verse eid="ROM 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Eye, me ndi na tadi ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:38">a hu bibaayaka na dyambu tso limosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:38">bibaayaka luutwala utahula bisu na litondo la nde ve:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:38">tso lipfu, tso moonyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:38">tso bapofi, tso bipfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:38">tso taangu a loloyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:38">tso taangu yi yili mu uya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:38">tso matwala ma pila mu pila,<verse eid="ROM 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />tso matwala ma hu yulu, tso ma ŋa toto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:39">tso pasi iloho hi Nzambi havanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:39">Isiha tso imosi utwala utahula bisu na litondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:39">bibaayaka Nzambi hamweesi bisu mu Yisu Kristo Pfumu a bisu ve.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi na baatu ba nde hasoolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ma me ndi mu undeele mali ma mbuli. Me a handi mu upfuta ve, mu tooni ti me ndi itwadi na Kristo. Iluunzi hya me, itwadi na Livupu la Ngidi hili mu utiila me imbangi: <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />mutima a me aluula mu lingebe bibaayaka lilahi na mu munyongo wu avelefwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Eye, hukiiba bubwe ti, me mba wu baasinga, na wu atahuha na Kristo mu tooni libwe la baana ba ngu ba me Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Bo ni bisu Isereli: Nzambi akitusa bo baana ba nde. Nde amweese bo muyusu a nde, nde asiidi likoongo na bo, na aviidi bo Mikele, nde ayuhisini na bo buni bo bafwana ukuunda nde, na nde asiidi bo malahi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">bisu Isereli </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Pal 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Pfu 7.6</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 11:1">Ose 11.1</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Bo bali imbisa hi bakaaha ba bo, na Kristo mu bumuutu bwa nde bibaayaka musi ibandu hya bo. Nde ni Nzambi wu bibaayaka ŋa yulu a byosi. Nyaha ba baayuusa nde taangu yoosi. Amen!<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mambu ma Nzambi ma maavele na tsoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Me a handi mu undeele ve ti Mambu ma Nzambi mali ma maavele na tsongo. Ka boosi ba bali imbisa hya Yakobi a bali bisu Isereli ba mbuli ve.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Mat 23.19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:10">Esa 55.10</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ka a baana boosi ba Abrahami bali imbisa hya nde ve. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi aleeli huli Abrahami ti: «Ni mu Isaaki we ubaha imbisa hi buuteele imbisa hi me atsi we lahi».<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:29">Ngl 3.29</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:23">4.23</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:12">Mba 21.12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:18">Heb 11.18</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Pila mosi ti, a baana boosi ba imbisa hya Abrahaami mu musunya bali baana ba Nzambi ve. Ndulu baana ba babuta we bu huli lahi, bali imbisa hya nde hya mbuli. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Nzambi aviidi lahi la nde bu: «Mu ilima hi hyuya me unzapfutaha. Na Sara ubuta mwana wa bahala.»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Mba 18.10</ref> </char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Titswene, hwaba bumosi kaka mu Lebeka wu abuti mavasa ndulu na bahala limosi Isaki, kaaha a bisu. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Abeedi kini ababuti baana mo baana ve, na bo kaka aba kini a bavangi dyambu bibaayaka libwe tso bibaayaka libi ve, ŋa Nzambi hayambili huli Lebeka, mana makani ma Nzambi, ma mali we bu huli tsolili a nde makwilala. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Makani mo maana mali tsolili a nde, mo mali mbila a nde huli baatu, ka a mu mavaanga ma bo ve. Nzambi aleeli huli Lebeka: «Mukulu usalila muheehe a nde.» <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />We bu Mabasonehe mali mu uleele: «Me atsooli Yakobi, ka me anyahi Esawu.»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Mba 25.23</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mal 1.2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Buuna, hima luuleelaani? Nzambi a hali wu akuha ve? Naana! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Eye, nde aleeli huli Moose: «Me tsa kwila lingebe huli pasi wu me tondi ukwila lingebe. Me umba wu mubwe huli muutu wu me tondi ubweye na nde.»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Pal 33.19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ni buuna, bubwe bwa Nzambi a buli mu litondo la muutu, buuve mu mifudi mya nde ve. Ka ndulu huli Nzambi wu ubakwila baatu lingebe. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, Nzambi bibaayaka mu uleele huli mutumi a tsi a Ngipiti: «Me atsuusi we pfumu, mana me mweese we matwala ma me, na nduhi a me yiyabahana mu toto yoosi.»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Pal 9.16</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi ubakwila lingebe huli muutu wu nde atondi ukwila lingebe na nde ubaatumbasa woosi wu nde atondi utumbasa.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kesi na kwili lingebe bya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Peleve we sa fuula me: «Ka mu hima Nzambi ubafwengele bisu? Na utwala ubisa mambu ma Nzambi ubatondo?» <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Homo ati, we muutu, na we bibaayaka, mu ukaakana na Nzambi? Nzungu a biinga utwala ufuula huli muyuhi a yo: «Mu hima we ayuha me bunuubu?»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Esa 29.16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45.9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Muyuhi madiiha ubayuha mu liba, bu nde atondi uyuha. Mu liba mo liina, nde utwala uyuha itehili hya tsoongo buuve hi hyavele a tsoongo. <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Nzambi akiitondo umweese kesi na uyabisa matwala ma nde huli bitehili bikima. Ka nde akuundi na mukami wu munene, bitehili bya kesi, bi bavangi mu utsala. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Eye, we lima ubweleele, tso Nzambi asiidi buuna, mu umweese busina bu muyusu a nde huli bitehili bi nde hakwili lingebe. Bitehili bi nde hatswamini uvangimasa mu tooni muyusu a nde.<verse eid="ROM 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Baatu mo ni bisu. Bisu ba nde haateeli, a ndulu ba ŋa hati bibaayaka Bayudaayo ve, ka napa ba ŋa hati la ba bavele Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ni mambu mo maana Nzambi ali mu uleele mu Libuuku bibaayaka mumbihuli Oseya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">«Baatu ba baba bavele ba ibandu hya me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">me tsa teele bo ibandu hya a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">na tsi yi me akaveletondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">me tsa teele yo tsi yi me atondo huulahi.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Na hu baleeli bo: “Benu a lili ibandu hya me ve”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">sa bateele bo baana ba Nzambi a moonyi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.25-26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 25</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:25">Ose 2.25</ref></char>v. 26<char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:1">Ose 2.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Mu mamatali baatu ba Isereli, mumbihuli Esaya bibaayaka mu uyabisa: «Ka tso bisu Isereli bali bulahi we musyeŋunyu mu muvanga mubu, ka ndulu baatu hoole ba busaala ŋa hati la bo, bu uyoboho. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Mambu ma Pfumu haleeli, nde sa avangimasa mo mosi mu mawasa ŋa toto.» <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Na we bu Esaya mo hatswamini uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">«Tso Pfumu a tsi yoosi a haasiisi bisu mwa bateehudu ba imbisa hya benu ve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">bisu laakinyambana we musyenge a Sodoomo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">na bakisyembe bisu we musyenge a Ngomooro!»<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi ubakuhasa ba bubasa Yisu imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Hima luleele mu taangu yi? Bunuubu: baatu ba matsi makima ba bavelesaha uba ba butsiitsa ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, baka ba butsiitsa ŋa busu bwa nde mu imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Ka baatu ba ibandu hya Isereli ba bakasaha uba ba butsiitsa ŋa miisu ma Nzambi mu likumbasa bibaayaka Mikele, a batwali ukiinza Mikele ve. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Mu ki tooni? Mu tooni ati, bo a bakasaha uba ba butsiitsa mu imiinu ve, ka mu mavaanga. Bo bayakubana manya bibaayaka libabwisa baatu, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Me ndi mu utsusa mu musyenge a Syoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">manya bibaayaka libakubasa baatu baku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">manya bibaayaka linene bibaayaka libabwisa baatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ka pasi muutu wu usa imiinu mu nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">a humono tsonyi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Esa 8.14-15</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Baana ba ngu, me ndi mu utsaha mu mutima a me woosi, na bibaayaka me umbapondo taangu yoosi huli Nzambi mu masambulu ma me, ni ti bisu Isereli bayoboho. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Na me umbatiila bo imbangi mo hinihi: Bo bali na lehemene bibaayaka linene mu Nzambi, ka lehemene la bo a laayaluha mu nzaabili ve. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Ni mu buuna, bo a batsikaha buni Nzambi ubasa ti baatu baba ba butsiitsa ŋa busu bwa nde ve. Na bo ubasaha ma bo mwakulu manzila ma uba butsiitsa. Ni buuna, bo a basiingala nzila yi Nzambi hasalila mu ubita baatu mu uba ba butsiitsa ve. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Mu tooni ati, Kristo ni kaluha Mikele mya Moose, mana boosi ba nga imiinu mu Yisu, baba ba butsiitsa ŋa busu bwa Nzambi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boosi ba buuteele Pfumu sa bayoboho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Moose asonihi bunuubu, mu tooni butsiitsa bu bubamata mu Mikele: «Muutu wu bibaayaka mu usalila bu huli matumili ma Mikele, sa aba moonyi mu mo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18.5</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ka mono buni butsiitsa bu bubamata mu imiinu buli mu uleele: «A haleele hutso mutima a we: Na uvata hu yulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12">Pfu 30.12</ref> </char></note>?» Mbindulili ni ti: mu usutasa Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />A haleele kaka ve: «Na ukulamana natee hutso a mbeenge ya doheselee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mbeenge ya doheselee </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbeenge yi bavelemono hu yaasuka.</char></note>» Mbindulili ni ti: mu upalisa Kristo ŋa hati la babakwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Nde buni ali mu uleele? Bunuubu: «Dyambu labaambana na we, mu munywa na mu mutima a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:4">Pfu 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">30.12-14</ref></char></note>» Mbindulili ni ti: liina ni dyambu bibaayaka imiinu bibaayaka bisu libalongese. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Tso we bibaayaka mu usilasa buuna mu munywa a we ŋa busu bwa boosi ti Yisu ni Pfumu, na tso we bibaayaka mu usa imiinu mu mutima a we woosi ti, Nzambi asuula nde ŋa hati la ba bakwa, we sa yoboho. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Mu tooni ati, wu ubasa imiinu mutso mutima a nde Nzambi ukitula nde wa tsiitsa. Wu ubasilasa mu munywa a nde, Nzambi uyobolo nde. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ni mu buuna Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Woosi wu ubasa imiinu mu nde, a humono tsonyi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Esa 28.16</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />A huli na lisobosono ŋa hati bibaayaka Bayudaayo na ba bavele Bayudaayo ve: bo boosi Pfumu mumosi wu ubava busina bwa nde huli boosi ba bubateele nde. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Mu tooni ati, Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Woosi wu uteele Pfumu mbila, sa ayoboho.»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:5">Yoe 3.5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Ka buni bo buuteele mbila huli wu bo bavelesa imiinu mu nde? Na buni bo buusa imiinu hwavele uyuha tsangu a nde? Na buni bo buuyuha tsangu a nde hwavele milongisi? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Buni milongisi myusoloho tso a batsindihi myo ve? We bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Miilu mya bo mili mi mibwe, bo bana ba bali mu uyabisa misamu mi mibwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Esa 52.7</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ka boosi a basiingala Musamu wu Mubwe ve. Na mumbihuli Esaya atswamini ufuula: «Pfumu, na asa imiinu mu musamu wu bisu lili mu uyabisa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Esa 53.1</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Ni mu buuna, imiinu ubamata mu mambu ma bubayuha, na mambu ma bubayuha ubamata mu mambu ma Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Nzambi a hanyasula baatu ba nde ve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Buuna me ndi mu upfuula: Bayudaayo a bayuhi musamu mo wuuna ve? Eye, bo bayuhi nde! Mu tooni ati, Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«Ndaha a bo yaayuhini mu toto yoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">na mambu ma bo balongisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">maamiito natee hu tsi yaasuka.»<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Me ndi mu umbwepfuula: baatu ba Isereli kini a batsikaha ve? Moose aba ni muutu watsomi mu ufutala mvutu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«Me utsa ti benu liba na likwabi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">mu ibandu hi bangoyi, huleeli Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">me utsimbalala kesi a benu mu baatu ba bavele na buyedi.»<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Esaya aleeli na butuuta bwosi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Me miitsoloho huli baatu ba bakavelesaha me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">Me miimonehele huli baatu ba bakavelefuula me pasi dyambu.»<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ka uto ti mu bisu Isereli, nde aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«Bilumbu byosi, me ndi mu unzala myoho mya me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">mu uyaka baatu ba nga kene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">na batumbihi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.18-21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 18: <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 19:5">Mkg 19.5</ref></char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 19: <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Pfu 32.21</ref></char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 20-21: <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:1-2">Esa 65.1-2</ref></char>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu upfuula: Nzambi baatu ba nde hanyasula? Naana, ubila ve! Me mwakulu muutu hu Isereli me ndi, wu imbisa hya Abrahami, wa buli la Benyamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nzambi a hanyasula baatu ba nde hamiitswamina uyaaba ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:14">Mkg 94.14</ref> </char></note>. Yibuhalaani moonyi mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, ma mali mu ngu musamu wu mumbihuli Eliya ali mu unyongele Isereli ŋa busu bwa Nzambi: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />«Pfumu, bo bamiiduba mimbihuli mya we, bamiitsala madiiku ma we ma bungodu. Na me amiitsaala siha vii. Na bo baka mu usaha umaasa muvumu a me.» <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Ka mono mvutu yi Nzambi haviidi nde: «Me amaasili me mwakulu biveeve tsambu (7 000) bi babahala ba bavelikongemene ŋa busu bwa nzambi a Baale.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nzambi a Baale </char><char style="ft" closed="false">inzanzambi hi bana ba Isereli baka sambila.</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:10-18">1Pf 19.10-18</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ni bumosi kaka mu taangu a loloyi, hwasaala mwa litangu la baatu ba Nzambi hasoolo mu hyese hya nde. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Nde hasoolo bo mu hyese hya nde, ka a mu tooni mavaanga ma bo ve. Tso a buuna ve, hyese hya Nzambi a hisaali hyese ve.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ka hima? Baatu ba Isereli a babaha hi bo bakasaha ve. Ka ndulu ba nde hasoolo bayaki hi bo bakasaha. Ka uto ti bakima, bamiikondosono bo utsikaha, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />we bu huli Mabasonehe: «Nzambi aviidi bo livupu bibaayaka butsuudu, nde adibuhi bo miisu mana bavelemono, na matswi mana baveleyuha natee loloyi.» <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Mutumi Davidi kaka bibaayaka mu uleele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«Nyaha mikungi mya bo mi udya mikituha mweto huli bo, siinga, baku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">nzila yi uyaka tsyembili yi yayelemene mu bo.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Nyaha miisu mya bo miba piipidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">mu iteesi hyubwevelemono.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">Hodemese bo mungoongo hwanzyeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 29:3">Pfu 29.3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Esa 6.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">29.10</ref></char> v. 9-10: <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:23-24">Mkg 69.23-24</ref></char>.</note>».<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu upfuula: ŋa bisu Isereli bakubi baku, bo nzyeni babwidi? Peleve naana! Ka mu tooni a mbwili a bo mu ma mabi, bangoyi bayaki liyobolo, mana bisu Isereli bamono nyengi. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Na tso mbwili Bayudaayo mu ma mabi yaabeedi dyambu lilibwe bibaayaka linene mu toto yoosi, na ubwa hwa bo hwaviidi busina bu livupu huli bangoyi, ki pila bunene bwa dyambu bibaayaka libwe luuba mu pfutihili a bo yi yakuha hu liyobolo!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Me ndeele huli benu ba laavele Bayudaayo: Me wu ndi iluumbi hya ba bavele Bayudaayo, me ndi mu unzuusa isalu hya me, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />mana tso me twali, me tsimbalala nyengi a baatu ba me, mana bakima ŋa hati la bo bayoboho. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Mu tooni ati, tso uvengolo hu Bayudaayo hwaba ni unongese hwa tsi na Nzambi, buni huuba mu taangu yi buubweyaka bo? Sa huba pfutihili a lipfu hu moonyi.<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miti myole mya olive</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Tso kabu latsomi bibaayaka lipa bali mu uva huli Nzambi, kabu lina bibaayaka limiisaala lili kaka la nde. Tso manganzi ma muti baviidi huli Nzambi, bitabi kaka bili bya nde. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Isereli hili we muti a olive wu Nzambi amiikese bitabi bikima. Ŋa mbuha a byo, bamiikatisa we, we wu avele Muyudaayo. Baamiikatisa we, we itabi hi muti a olive wa piinda. Bunuubu, we ka mu ubahila mu malimbu ma mali mu ukuma mu linganzi bibaayaka muti a olive. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ni mu buuna, we a harokolo bitabi bi bakese. Buni we utwala usyenolo mapapanga? A ni we ubahwadisa linganzi ve, ka ni linganzi libahwadisa we.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />We sa leele me: «Baakesi bitabi mo biina, mu unamiha me ŋa mbuha a byo.» <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ni buuna hwa nde. Baakesi byo, mu tooni ati, byo a byaba na imiinu ve. Na baminamiha we, mu tooni imiinu hya we. Ka a hasa nyeme! Homo ba na boomo! <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ka tso Nzambi avengolo Bayudaayo ba bali bitabi bi muti a mbuli, kele hwa we! We wu bibaayaka itabi hi banamiha, mana nde a havengolo we kaka. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Ni mu buuna, tsikaha bubwe bwa Nzambi na bunono bwa nde: nde bibaayaka mu umweese bunono bwa nde huli ba bamiibwa, na bubwe bwa nde mu we, tso we kwilili mu bubwe mo buuna. Tso a buuna ve, sa bakese we kaka we bitabi bikima. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ka tso Bayudaayo bayafutaha na basiidi imiinu, Nzambi sa abwekatisa bo kaka ŋa mbuha yi bo babeedi tsomi. Buuna Nzambi na matwala ma ubwekatisa bo. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ni mu buuna, we itabi hi muti a olive wa mu piinda, Nzambi akesi we na akatisi we mu muti a Olive wu bakuna, na wu bibaayaka na lisobosono na muti wu baamaasi we. Ka uto ti Bayudaayo, bo bali bitabi bya mbuli bi muti a Olive wa mbuli: Ni mu buuna, Nzambi ubwekatisa bo mu muti wu bo babeedi tsomi.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Liyobolo bibaayaka Isereli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Baana ba ngu, me tondi ti benu liyaaba matswehi ma Nzambi mo maniima, mana benu a libamonehele we bangeele: kabu limosi la baatu ba Isereli sa likwilala hutso a dungili, natee bu boosi ba bali bangoyi buuyaka liyobolo. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ni buuna, buli bibaayaka Isereli loosi luuyoboho, we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">«Muyobili sa amata hu isyelo hya Syoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">nde umaasa bubi bu imbisa hya Yakobi.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Yiina ni nzuhisini a me yi me utsa na bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">ŋa me umaasa masumu ma bo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">Esa 59.20-21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:9">Esa 27.9</ref> </char></note>»<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Tso limoni ubisa hwa bo hu Musamu wu Mubwe, bo baka bambene ba Nzambi mu libwe la benu. Ka tso litelimi ŋa busu bwa tsolili a Nzambi, nde kini mu utondo bo, mu tooni bakaaha ba bo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ka Nzambi a hubapatula hi nde hamiikwava ve. Na nde a hubasobo matsimi ŋa busu bwa ba nde hamiiteele ve. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Mu taangu a tsomi, benu laabisili Nzambi. Ka bunuubu, Nzambi amiikwila benu lingebe, mu tooni ati Bayudaayo babisili nde. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ni bumosi kaka, kene a bo mu taangu mo yiniiyi yili mu usa ti benu liyaka kwili lingebe ya Nzambi, na mana bo kaka bayaka kwili lingebe mo yiina<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:8">Esa 55.8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:6">Mkg 139.6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 139:17-18">17-18</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi amiikangimasa baatu boosi hutso a kene, mana nde amweese kwili lingebe a nde huli boosi.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Nyimbu muyusu a bunene bwa Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Ki pila bunene bu busina bwa Nzambi! Ki pila idoongi hi buyedi na nzaabili a nde! Na utwala ubindula makesili ma nde? Na utwala utsikaha malahi ma nde? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />We bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uyabisa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">«Na yaabi matsimi ma Pfumu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Na utwala uba muviidi a nde wu mandoongi?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Na atswamini uva nde isiha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">mana nde akeele uyaka pfuta hu mbisa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Esa 40.13</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Byosi bibamata huli Nzambi, mu nde, na byo bili bya nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Nyaha muyusu aba huli Nzambi mu bilima na bilima! Amen!<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Uyuusa we bu hwafwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Baana ba ngu, mu tooni ati, Nzambi amiimweese bubwe bwa nde mu bisu, me ndi mu upondo huli benu, mu uyeholo nde nyutu a benu we bungodu bwa moonyi, bwa ngidi, bu Nzambi husilasa. Buuna, benu sa liyuusa Nzambi we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />A liduukala bipfu bya baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi ve. Ka nyahaani Nzambi akitusa benu na uva benu buyedi bu bunyatihi. Na benu sa litsikaha litondo la Nzambi: ma mabwe ma nde hatondo, na ma masupahana.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udyata mu litondo itwadi na Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Mu tooni bungodu bu Nzambi hava me mu bubwe bwa nde, me ndi mu upondo huli pasi nde mu benu, mu uveletsima ti nde alutaala bana. Ka nyaha pasi muutu mu benu aba we bu huli iteesi hya kabu bibaayaka imiinu hi Nzambi hava nde. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Buuna, mu nyutu ndulu mosi, bisu lili na binama bi bilahi. Ka pasi inama na isalu hya hyo. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Bumosi kaka, tso lili ba balahi, bisu a benu lili nyutu ndulu mosi itwadi na Kristo, na lili itwadi bana na bana we binama bya nyutu ndulu mosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ka bisu a benu lili na bungodu bu bwasobono we bu hu bibaayaka hyese hi Nzambi akabila muutu muutu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:6">Tso mumosi mu bisu a benu bibaayaka na bungodu bu ubihula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:6">nyaha nde abaasalila bwo we bu hu bibaayaka imiinu.<verse eid="ROM 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Tso mukima bibaayaka na bungodu bu usalila bana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:7">nyaha abaasalila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:7">Wu bibaayaka na bungodu bu ulongese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:7">nyaha abalongese.<verse eid="ROM 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Wu bibaayaka na bungodu bu uhwadisa bana mu mavaanga ma mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:8">nyaha abahwadisa bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:8">Wu bibaayaka na bungodu bu ukaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:8">nyaha abaasalila bwo mu mutima wu mubwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:8">Wu bibaayaka mu utuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:8">nyaha abaatuma na lehemene loosi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:8">Wu bibaayaka mu ukumbasa nga puumbu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:8">nyaha abakumbasa na kinya.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Nyaha litondo liba bibaayaka laavele na muwala. Belelaani bubi, kangamaani mu ma mabwe.<verse eid="ROM 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Luulaani mu litondo bana mu bana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:10">we binama bya buli limosi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:10">Baani batsomi mu ukiinza bana.<verse eid="ROM 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Baani na lehemene mu isalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:11">ka a liba babolo ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:11">Salilaani Pfumu mu mutima a benu woosi.<verse eid="ROM 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Baani na kinya mu tooni a hiitu hya benu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:12">Baani na mukami mu taangu a pasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:12">baasambilaani na mukonono.<verse eid="ROM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Baakumbasaani banga imiinu ba bali na nzala likumbasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:13">na bayakaani bubwe taangu yoosi, ba bali mu uya mu manzo ma benu.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Vondelaani ba bali mu utsuta benu lisyeme la Nzambi. Vondelaani bo lisyeme, ka a livondele bo musingu ve<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ufwanisa na </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mty 5.44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luk 6.28</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Baani mu kinya na baatu ba bali mu kinya, na lilaani na ba bali mu ulila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Baani mu hyenze ŋa hati la benu. A liba na peyu mu bi byasyenoho ve, ka baasahaani bi byavelemonehele ŋa miisu ma baatu. A limonehele we bangeele benu mwakulu ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:21">Esa 5.21</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />A lifutala ma mabi mu ma mabi ve, ka hwadaani mu ubasa ma mabwe ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Tso benu litwali ukuhasa buuna, mu iteesi hi hyahwama na benu, baani mu hyenze na baatu boosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Bambaahi ba litondo, a lifutala piinga huli ba bubavangila benu bubi ve, ka nyahaani Nzambi amweese kesi a nde. Mu tooni ati basonehe bunuubu: «Me ni wu ufutala piinga, me ni wu ufutala huli pasi muutu we bu hu bibaayaka mavaanga ma nde», buleeli Pfumu.<verse eid="ROM 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Na nde abweleele bunuubu: «Tso muboho a we bibaayaka na nzala, va nde byudya. Tso nde bibaayaka na peyu, va nde byunywa. Mu tooni a ŋa we bibaayaka mu usa buuna, we bibaayaka mu ukuukaha nde makala ma mbaahu ŋa yulu mutswe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.19-20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Pfu 32.35</ref></char> v. 20 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Mak 25.21-22</ref></char>.</note>.» <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />A nyaha bubi bubiingala we ve, ka nyaha we ba mubiingili a libi mu libwe.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Batumi bali mu usalila Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Pasi muutu afwana uba hu tsina lituma bibaayaka babyalisa. Mu tooni ati, pasi lituma ubamata huli Nzambi. Ni Nzambi ubabyalisa baatumi boosi. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Ni mu buuna, woosi wu ubabisala lituma, nde bibaayaka mu ubisala lituma la Nzambi. Ba bali mu utelemene lituma, bo bali mu uteele tsundusu ŋa yulu a bo mwakulu. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Bunuubu, ba bali mu uvanga ma mabwe, utwala ubata boomo bu banzonzi ve, ka ni ba bali mu uvanga ma mabi. Ka tso we a tondi uba na boomo bu baatumi ve, buuna vanga ma mabwe. Lituma sa lisilasa we. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ka lituma lili mu usalila Nzambi mu libwe la we. Ka tso we bibaayaka mu uvanga bibaayaka libi, ba na boomo. Mu tooni ati, a mu pu baatumi bali na matwala ma usyembe ve. Lituma lili mu usalila Nzambi, mu umweese kesi a lo huli muutu wu bibaayaka mu uvanga bubi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ni mu buuna, hwafwana mu uba hu tsina lituma bibaayaka baatumi, a ndulu mu ubata kesi a Nzambi ve, ka na mu tooni a tumili yi yili mu umata mu mutima.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ni mu buuna kaka, benu libafuta limandu. Mu tooni ati, bakambi ba limandu bali hu tsina lituma la Nzambi mu uvangimasa bu hwafwana iteesi mo hiina. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Futalaani huli pasi muutu hi hyahwama na nde: futaani limandu huli wu benu laafwana ufuta lo, na makesili makima ma lituma libakamba, huli wu benu laafwana ufuta mo, muyusu huli wu benu laafwana uva muyusu, likiinzu huli wu benu laafwana uva likiinzu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:17-21">Mat 22.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mlk 12.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk 20.25</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Litondo bibaayaka munawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />A liba na mukanu a muutu ve, tso a ni mu utondosono benu na benu ve. Mu tooni ati, wu bibaayaka na litondo mu bana bibaayaka mu ukuhasa Mikele we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ni mu buuna, Mikele momiini: «A hasa mayamba ve, a haduba ve, a hayiba ve, a hasa linyungi ve», na mina myosi, myakuukama mu mukuma mumosi ni wunuwu: «Tondo muna a we, we bu we ubatondo we mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:13-17">Mba 20.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-21">Pfu 5.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Wu ubatondo, a habasa bibaayaka libi tso limosi huli muna a nde ve. Ni mu buuna, litondo bibaayaka muna a nde ni ukuhasa hu Mikele myosi.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uvangama mu nziili a Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Bu benu liyaabi mu ki taangu bisu a benu laaka, yiniiyi ka ni taangu huli benu mu usuuha hutso a tolo. Nziili a Yisu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nziili a Yisu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Liina ni liyobolo bibaayaka boosi bali mu ukeele.</char></note> yaamiifula bebele, na ŋa bisu a benu laasidyani imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Butsuhu bwaka lala, busi sa bukya. Nyaha litiimbaani mavaanga ma bisu ma piipidi, na lilwataani bilwanili bi liyalala. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Lidyataani mu mbiili yi yasungama, we bu hwafwana mu udyata ŋa nyangu. Linyahaani mikungi mi udya, malaangi, bumbembo tso mbiili yimbi, mitsotso tso nyengi. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Lwataani mbiili a Pfumu Yisu Kristo. A liduukala mbiili yi imuutu, mu uywatisa mapeyu ma nde ma mabi ve.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Uveletsundasa tso uvelerokolo wuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Yakaani muutu wu bibaayaka wu akolo mu imiinu, hwavele usobosono munywa mu matsimi ma nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:7-13">1Ko 8.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:23-33">10.23-33</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Ni mu buuna, imiinu hya muutu mumosi hibabita nde mu udya byosi bi bubadya. Ka mukima wu akolo mu imiinu, ubadya ndulu musooso. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Nyaha wu ubadya byosi avelesyebe wu aveledya nyama, na wu aveledya nyama, uveletsundasa wu ubadya byosi. Mu tooni ati Nzambi ayaka nde kaka. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />We na bibaayaka, we wu bibaayaka mu utsundasa musalili a wuna? Tso nde bibaayaka wu abama mu isalu, tso nde bwidi, liina lili mu utala pfumu a nde. Ka nde ukwilala wu abama, mu tooni ati Pfumu bibaayaka na matwala ma usika nde.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Muutu mumosi ubatsima ti, bilumbu byafulala bina tsoongo. Ka muutu mukima ubatsima ti, bilumbu a bili na lisobosono ve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pahuli bibaayaka mu utsima mu mavaanga ma mali mu umata mu tsalili Bayudaayo. Ufwanisa </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 4:10">Ngl 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2.16</ref></char>.</note>. Muutu muutu afwana uba na tadi mu ma nde ali mu utsima. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Woosi wu ubasa lisobosono bibaayaka bilumbu, bibaayaka mu usa buuna mu ukiinza Pfumu. Woosi wu ubadya byosi, bibaayaka mu udya kaka mu ukiinza Pfumu. Mu tooni ati nde ubafutala matondo huli Nzambi mu byudya bya nde. Na woosi wu ubaveledya byosi bibaayaka mu usa kaka buuna mu ukiinza Pfumu. Mu tooni ati, nde kaka ubafutala matondo huli Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />A hu bibaayaka na muutu ŋa hati la bisu a benu, wu bibaayaka moonyi mu tooni a nde mwakulu ve. Na, a hu bibaayaka kaka na muutu wu bibaayaka mu ukwa mu nde mwakulu ve. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Tso bisu a benu lili moonyi, bisu lili moonyi mu tooni a Pfumu. Na tso likwidi, bisu luukwa mu tooni a Pfumu. Ni mu buuna, tso laaba moonyi buuve tso laakwa, bisu lili ba Pfumu habaha. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Mu tooni ati Kristo amiikwa, na nde amiisuuha ŋa hati la ba bakwa, mu uba Mutumi ŋa yulu a babakwa na ba bali moonyi. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Ka we, mu hima we bibaayaka mu utsundasa mwana a ngu a we? Na we, mu hima bibaayaka mu upenye kedi a we? Bisu boosi sa liteleme ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu uyaka tsundusu a nde. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Mu tooni ati Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«Me Pfumu wu bibaayaka moonyi ndi mu undeele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Baatu boosi sa batsokomo ŋa busu bwa me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">na boosi sa basiinga Nzambi ŋa misu ma baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Esa 45.23</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ni mu buuna, pasi muutu mu bisu afwana uva ikuumbu huli Nzambi, mu mavaanga ma nde mwakulu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ni mu buuna, linyahaani utsundasa bana na bana.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ROM 14:13">Uvelebwisa wuna mu masumu</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 14:13">Volwaani kesili yi uvelebita wuna mu udunga nzila a Nzambi buuve yi imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mu Pfumu Yisu, me nzaabi mu tsiki yoosi ti a hu bibaayaka na isiha hi basa ngidi mu hyo mwakulu ve. Ka tso muutu tsimi ti hu bibaayaka na isiha hi basa ngidi, buuna hyo hili hi basa ngidi mu nde. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Tso we bibaayaka mu ukwamisa mwana a ngu a we mu bi we bibaayaka mu udya, we a hasaali dyata mu litondo ve. Mu tooni a byudya, a hanyambasana mwana a ngu a we, wu Kristo haakwidi mu nde ve. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Mambu ma mali ma mabwe huli we, a makituha huli baatu bakima mambu ma makusa ve. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Eye, Ipfumu hya Nzambi a hili dyambu la byudya, buuve la byunywa ve. Ka hyo hyakangama mu butsiitsa, hyenze na kinya, bi Livupu la Ngidi libava. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ni buuna, woosi wu ubaasalila Kristo mu biteesi mo biina, bibaayaka wu mubwe ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, na baatu bubasilasa nde.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ni mu buuna, nyaha lisahaani bi bibabehe hyenze na bi bibava bisu muswa mu ukumbasana mu ukula mu imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />A haduba isalu hya Nzambi mu tooni a byudya. Eye, byudya byosi bili bi byatsyeme. Ka ni bubi huli muutu, tso nde diidi isiha hi hyudungasa mwana a ngu nzila a Nzambi buuve yi imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Dyambu bibaayaka laafwana ni mu uveledya nyama, mu uvelenywa malamu, na mu ubisa byosi bi byutwala ubwisa mwana a ngu mu lisumu. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Imiinu hya we mu dyambu mo linili, keelese hyo mu we mwakulu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Kinya yili na muutu wuuna wu aveletsundana mu tooni makesili ma nde! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ka wu bibaayaka na matsika mu byudya, Nzambi amiisyembe nde. Mu tooni ati, mbiili a nde a yaayelemene na imiinu hya nde ve. Na liyaabi ti, mambu moosi ma muutu ubaavaanga, maveleyelemene na imiinu hya nde, mali masumu.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kwadisili a baana ba ngu mu imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Bisu ba laahwada mu imiinu, laafwana ukumbasa ba bakolo. A lisaha mu ukuhasa mapeyu ma bisu mwakulu ve. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Nyaha pasi muutu mu bisu a benu, asaha hi hyumweese munawe kinya mu libwe la nde, mana nde akula mu imiinu. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Eye, Kristo a hasahi libwe la nde mwakulu ve. Ka we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: «Bituhi bi bakatuha we, byayaabwa ŋa yulu a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Mkg 69.10</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Moosi ma mali mutso a Mabasonehe ma Ngidi tsikulu, basonihi mo mu uva bisu nzaabili. Mana bisu libaha hiitu mu mukami na kwadili bi mo mali mu uva bisu. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nyaha Nzambi wu bibaayaka mu uva bisu mukami, na kwadisili, ava benu bunyanga mu ubaba likoongo we bu huli tumili a Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Buuna, boosi itwadi, mu ndaha mosi, yuusaani Nzambi, wu bibaayaka Taata a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo musalili a boosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Mu ukuka, bayakasanaani we bu Kristo haayaki benu, mana baatu bayusa Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ka bibaayaka me ndi mu utsilasa ni liniili: hati a tsomi, Kristo ayidi mu usalila Bayudaayo mu usilasa ti Nzambi bibaayaka mu uleele mbuli. Ni mu liina, nde hakuhisi malahi ma Nzambi asiidi huli bakaaha ba bo. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Ni bumosi kaka, ba bavele Bayudaayo, bali mu uyusa Nzambi mu bubwe bwa nde, we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Ni mu buuna, me tsa pa we muyusu ŋa hati bibaayaka bibandu bikima bya ŋa toto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">na me tsa nzimba mu tooni muyusu a nduhi a we.»<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu ubweleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">«Benu bibandu bi matsi moosi, baani mu kinya na ibandu hya Pfumu!» <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Mali mu ubweleele bunuubu: «Yusaani Pfumu, benu matsi moosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">yimbaani nyimbu yi muyusu a nde, benu bibandu byosi!»<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Mumbihuli Esaya kaka bibaayaka mu uleele: «Imbisa hya Yese hyuya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">nde uteleme mu utuma bibandu bikima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">matsi moosi sa masiila nde hiitu»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.9-12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 9: <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 18:50">Mkg 18.50</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:50">2Sa 22.50</ref></char>v. 10: <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Pfu 32.43</ref></char> v. 11: <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Mkg 117.1</ref></char> v. 12: <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Esa 11.10</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Nyaha Nzambi wu ubava hiitu, aluusa benu mu kinya na mu hyenze bi byakuha mu imiinu hya benu mu nde. Mana benu liluula mu hiitu hi matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalu hya Pahuli huli ba bavele Bayudaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Baana ba ngu, me ndodi lo, mitima mya benu myaluula mu matsimi ma mabwe, na mu nzaabili yi yaayelemene. Na benu laaka mu iteesi hi uvasasana mandoongi. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ka me miitsonehele benu na mwana wasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wasa pila mosi ibahala.</char></note>, hutso mihanda mu mambuha ma malahi, mu uyibwala benu moonyi, mu ma benu laamiikwayaba. Me atsonehe buuna, mu tooni a hyese hi Nzambi hava me, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />mu uba musalili a Yisu Kristo huli ba bavele Bayudaayo. Me ndi mu utsa isalu hya ngaanga a Nzambi, hi uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe a Nzambi, mana ba bavele Bayudaayo bakituha bungodu bu bubwe, bu Nzambi husilasa, bu bamiisyeme mu matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ni mu buuna, mu itwadi na Yisu Kristo, me ndi na nyeme mu tooni isalu hya me mu Nzambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Ka tso me utwala uleele dyambu, ndulu ni mu bibaayaka Kristo hasalila mu me, mu ubehe ba bavele Bayudaayo mu usiingala Nzambi. Nde hakuhasa lo, mu mambu ma maapala mu munywa a me na mu mavaanga ma me, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />mu matwala ma biliimbu bya kimuhili, na bipadi, mu matwala ma Livupu la Nzambi. Mono buni me anzabisi we bu hwafwana Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo, mu ubayene matsyelo moosi, umata musyenge a Yeruselemi natee hu itaanzi hya Iliriya. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ka me na muyusu mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, ndulu mu mambuha ma baatu bakini a bayuhi Tsangu a Kristo ve. Mu tooni uveletunga ŋa yulu ibeene hi mukima hatunga. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Me apaanga we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">«Huli ba baveliyabisa lo, sa bamono nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">na ba baveliyuha lo, sa batsikaha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boosi huli bo bana ba baveliyabisa nde sa bamono nde, naa ba baveliyuha tsangu a nde sa ba bangula </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Esa 52.15</ref></char>.</note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makani ma midyenge mya Pahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Yiina ni tooni yi yaasiidi ti me pelenza taangu yoosi huli benu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ka bunuubu, me miitsukasa isalu hya me mu bitaanzi mo biniibi. Umata bilima bi bilahi, me na nzala yindahi mu uyamono benu <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />na me tondi usa buuna ŋa me unzyene hu Esipanye. Mu tooni ati, me na hiitu hi umono benu ŋa me upyoho na uyaka likumbasa la benu mu mudyenge mu tsi mo yiina, humbisa utsahala na benu mu mwa bilumbu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ka mu taangu mo yiniiyi, me ndi mu unzyene hu Yeruselemi mu uyakuhasa isalu hya ba libundu ba bali huuna. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Eye, mabundu ma Masedonya na ma Akayi, maakese mu ukukaha bungodu bwa bo, bu ukumbasa ba nga puumbu ba libundu la Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Bo mwakulu bakese buuna. Ka tso lisinzitsikaha, huli bo beedi aka we mukanu. Mu tooni ati, tso Bayudaayo ba libundu bali mu uva labo kabu bibaayaka busina bu livupu, huli ba bavele Bayudaayo ba libundu, bo kaka bafwana ukumbasa Bayudaayo ba libundu mu bi bo bali na byo nzala. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ŋa me umana isalu mo hiina, na ŋa me upa bo pahu mo yiina, me tsa nzyene hu Esipanye na me tsa pyohele huli benu. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Na me nzaabi ti ŋa me unziila benu, ni na lisyeme la Kristo bibaayaka lafulala me unza. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Me ndi mu upondo benu liniili bana ba ngu, mu tooni a Pfumu Yisu Kristo na mu tooni litondo bibaayaka Livupu libava: lwanaani itwadi na me mu uvondele me hyese huli Nzambi mu masambulu ma benu. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Sambilaani mana me pelembwa ŋa myoho mya ba bavelesa imiinu ba hu itaanzi hya Yude, na mana libundu bibaayaka musyenge a Yeruselemi liyaka likumbasa bibaayaka me ndi mu umbitala bo, mu mutima mumosi. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Buuna, tso Nzambi tondi, me tsa nza huli benu na kinya yindahi mu mutima. Na me tsa polo mwana taangu mu uvuuma na benu. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nyaha Nzambi wu ubava hyenze, aba na benu boosi. Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Me pondi huli benu mu uyaka kedi a bisu Febe, wu bibaayaka mukeelisi libundu la Sankereya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Yakaani nde mu Yisu, Pfumu a bisu, we bu hwafwana mu uyaka bangidi. Kumbasaani nde mu pasi dyambu bibaayaka nde huba na nzala a benu. Mu tooni ati nde akumbasa ba balahi, homo me mwakulu. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Bilaani Pilisile na Akilasi, batsyengi ba me ba isalu mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Bo basyeti mivumu mya bo mu ufuuhasa me. Me a handi siha mu ufutala bo matondo ve. Mabundu moosi ma ba bavele Bayudaayo kaka, mali mu usilasa bo. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Bilaani kaka libundu bibaayaka libatsonzomo mu nzo a bo. Bilaani kaka Epayineti, mbaahi a me wu litondo, nde bibaayaka watsomi mu usa imiinu mu Kristo mu itaanzi hya Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Bilaani Mariya, wu amoni pasi yindahi mu benu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Bilaani Andonikusi na Yunyasi, ikuta hya me, bo ba baba na me mu kondaayi. Bu basilasa bo ŋa hati bibaayaka biluumbi, na bo batswamini me uyaka Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Bilaani Ampyatuse, mbaahi a me wu afulala litondo mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Bilaani Uribani, tsyengi a bisu wu isalu mu Kristo, na Sitakyusi, wa me wu litondo. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Bilaani Apelisi wu amweesi me imbuli hi imiinu hya nde mu Kristo. Bilaani ba bali mu nzo a Aristobule. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Bilaani Elodyoni, ikuta hya me. Bilaani ba mu nzo a Narasise ba bubasa imiinu mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Bilaani Tirifene na Tirifosi, bakaasu ba bali mu usala mu tooni a Pfumu, na wa me wu litondo, Pereside wu asiidi isalu hiinene mu nduhi a Pfumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Bilaani Rufusi wu Pfumu hasooli, na ngu a nde, wu bibaayaka kaka ngu a me. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Bilaani Asinikrite, Felegoni na Heremesi, Patorobasi, Heremasi na baana ba ngu ba bali na bo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Bilaani Filologi, na Yulya, Nere na kedi a nde, na Olipasi na bangidi boosi ba bali na bo. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Bilasanaani mu pivili a tama yi bungidi. Mabundu ma Kristo moosi mabili benu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuminini ya tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Me ndi mu upondo huli benu baana ba ngu, kebaani mu ba bali mu ubehe buraandu husto libundu, na ba bali mu udungasa banga imiinu, mu utuna ndongisili yi benu laayaka. Tahuhaani na bo, <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />mu tooni ati, baatu ba pila mo yiina, a bali mu usalila Kristo Pfumu a bisu ve, ka mapeyu ma bo mwakulu. Na humbisa mikuma mya bo mi mibwe, na bileedi bya soho, bo bali mu upfuta ba bavele na tsikihili. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ka uto ti benu, boosi bayaabi lisiingala la benu mu Pfumu. Me ndi mu kinya mu benu. Ka me tondi ti benu liba banga tsiki mu uvanga ma mabwe, na uba ba batsyeme mu mitima mu ubata ma mabi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Nzambi wu ubava hyenze a hutaamba mu unyihula Saatana hu tsina matambi ma benu ve. Nyaha hyese hya Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo hiba na benu.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoteho, tsyengi a me mu isalu mu Kristo bibaayaka mu uva benu mabwehe. Ni bumosi, Lusyusi, Yasoni na Sozipatere, bikuta bya me, batsindihi benu mabwehe. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Me Terityusi wu bibaayaka dingisi mu usonehele benu muhanda mo wunuwu, me ndi mu utsindaha mabwehe ma me mu Pfumu wu bibaayaka mu upfuuta bisu a benu. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Ngayusi wu miiyaka me mu nzo a nde, viidi benu mabwehe. Ni huli nde libundu loosi libakuukama. Erasite, iswehe mbongo hi musyenge, na mwana a ngu Karitusi baviidi mabwehe.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Nyaha hyese hya Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo hiba na benu boosi! Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muyusu a tsyelele</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Liyusaani Nzambi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:25">Nde bibaayaka na matwala ma uhwadisa benu mu imiinu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:25">we bu hu bibaayaka Musamu wu Mubwe wu me ndi mu undongese na wu bibaayaka mu usangula Yisu Kristo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:25">na we bu hu bibaayaka nzabisili yi Nzambi hamiisa mu tswehi a nde yi liyobolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:25">yi nde haswehi umata beleve.<verse eid="ROM 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Bunuubu, tswehii mo liyobolo yimiimonehele paayalala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:26">mu nzila Mabuuku ma Mimbihuli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:26">we bu hu bibaayaka tumili a Nzambi wu avele na tsukusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:26">tswehi mo yaamiimonehele mu mabuli makima ma ŋa toto yoosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:26">mana mo masiila nde imiinu na masiingala nde.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Muyusu aba hu bibaayaka Nzambi, wu bibaayaka siha nga tsiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:27">mu Yisu Kristo, mu bilima na bilima!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:27">Ameni!<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>